# Resources/Prototypes/_KS14/Fluidmos/Entities/devices.yml
ent-KsFluidPort = fluid port
    .desc = A pipe fitting with a small tank. Pour reagents in to feed them into the pipe as liquid, or switch it to draw the pipe's liquid out.
# Resources/Prototypes/_KS14/Fluidmos/Entities/devices.yml
ent-KsPhaseSeparator = phase separator
    .desc = Pumps gas and vapor out of one side and lets liquid out of the other. Put a heater ahead of it and it is a still.
# Resources/Prototypes/_KS14/Fluidmos/Entities/devices.yml
ent-KsExpansionValve = expansion valve
    .desc = Lets liquid refrigerant through to the low side, where it flashes and chills. Can hold a set superheat by itself.
